e</a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors\'>Sobre</a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors\'>Contato</a> </div> <button class=\'bg-[#14362D] text-white px-6 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-full hover:bg-[#1B4332] transition-all shadow-lg\'> Falar com Consultor </button> </nav> <main class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col p-12 relative\'> <div class=\'flex-1 flex gap-12\'> <div class=\'w-2/3 flex flex-col justify-center\'> <div class=\'mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\'> <span class=\'h-[1px] w-12 bg-[#D4AF37]\'></span> <span class=\'text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\'>Estrat\303\251gia & Patrim\303\264nio</span> </div> <h1 class=\'text-7xl font-light leading-[0.9] tracking-tighter mb-8 serif italic\'> <span class=\'block opacity-100\'>Intelig\303\252ncia</span> <span class=\'block text-[#D4AF37] font-bold not-italic\'>Financeira</span> <span class=\'block\'>Sob Medida.</span> </h1> <p class=\'text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md opacity-70 mb-10\'> Transformamos dados complexos em decis\303\265es estrat\303\251gicas para impulsionar a sa\303\272de financeira do seu neg\303\263cio com precis\303\243o e transpar\303\252ncia. </p> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-8\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col\'> <span class=\'text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter\'>R$ 4.2B+</span> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50\'>Ativos sob Gest\303\243o</span> </div> <div class=\'w-[1px] h-12 bg-[#14362D1A]\'></div> <div class=\'flex flex-col\'> <span class=\'text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter\'>150+</span> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50\'>Empresas Atendidas</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'w-1/3 flex items-center\'> <div class=\'relative w-full aspect-[4/5] bg-[#14362D] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\'> <div class=\'absolute inset-0 opacity-20\' style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#D4AF37 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;\\\"></div> <div class=\'absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-end p-8 text-white\'> <div class=\'bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/10\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 block opacity-60\'>An\303\241lise de Fluxo</span> <div class=\'h-24 w-full flex items-end gap-1 mb-4\'> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#D4AF37] h-[40%] rounded-t-sm\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#D4AF37] h-[60%] rounded-t-sm\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#D4AF37] h-[55%] rounded-t-sm\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-white h-[90%] rounded-t-sm\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#D4AF37] h-[75%] rounded-t-sm\'></div> </div> <p class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Performance Mensal +22.4%</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'grid grid-cols-3 gap-8 pt-12 border-t border-[#14362D1A]\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-2\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37]\'>01. Consultoria</span> <h3 class=\'font-bold text-lg\'>Gest\303\243o de Fluxo</h3> <p class=\'text-xs opacity-60 leading-relaxed\'>Otimiza\303\247\303\243o de processos e controle rigoroso de tesouraria.</p> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-2\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37]\'>02. Planejamento</span> <h3 class=\'font-bold text-lg\'>Estrat\303\251gia Fiscal</h3> <p class=\'text-xs opacity-60 leading-relaxed\'>Redu\303\247\303\243o inteligente de custos e conformidade tribut\303\241ria.</p> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-2\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37]\'>03. Tecnologia</span> <h3 class=\'font-bold text-lg\'>Dashboard em Tempo Real</h3> <p class=\'text-xs opacity-60 leading-relaxed\'>Seus n\303\272meros acess\303\255veis de qualquer lugar, a qualquer hora.</p> </div> </div> </main> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Clean Minimalism\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Clean Minimalism\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#FDFCFB] text-[#14362D] font-sans flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative\'> <div class=\'absolute top-[-100px] right-[-100px] w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-[#14362D] opacity-[0.03] rounded-full blur-3xl\'></div> <div class=\'absolute bottom-[-50px] left-[-50px] w-[300px] h-[300px] bg-[#D4AF37] opacity-[0.05] rounded-full blur-3xl\'></div> <nav class=\'h-24 px-12 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#14362D1A] z-10\'> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2\'> <div class=\'w-8 h-8 bg-[#14362D] flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm\'> <div class=\'w-4 h-4 border-2 border-[#D4AF37] rotate-45\'></div> </div> <span class=\'text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase\'>Favo</span> </div> <div class=\'flex gap-10 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest opacity-80\'> <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors\'>Consultoria</a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors\'>An\303\241lise</a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors\'>Sobre</a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors\'>Contato</a> </div> <button class=\'bg-[#14362D] text-white px-6 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-full hover:bg-[#1B4332] transition-all shadow-lg\'> Falar com Consultor </button> </nav> <main class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col p-12 relative\'> <div class=\'flex-1 flex gap-12\'> <div class=\'w-2/3 flex flex-col justify-center\'> <div class=\'mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\'> <span class=\'h-[1px] w-12 bg-[#D4AF37]\'></span> <span class=\'text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\'>Estrat\303\251gia & Patrim\303\264nio</span> </div> <h1 class=\'text-7xl font-light leading-[0.9] tracking-tighter mb-8 serif italic\'> <span class=\'block opacity-100\'>Intelig\303\252ncia</span> <span class=\'block text-[#D4AF37] font-bold not-italic\'>Financeira</span> <span class=\'block\'>Sob Medida.</span> </h1> <p class=\'text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md opacity-70 mb-10\'> Transformamos dados complexos em decis\303\265es estrat\303\251gicas para impulsionar a sa\303\272de financeira do seu neg\303\263cio com precis\303\243o e transpar\303\252ncia. </p> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-8\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col\'> <span class=\'text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter\'>R$ 4.2B+</span> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50\'>Ativos sob Gest\303\243o</span> </div> <div class=\'w-[1px] h-12 bg-[#14362D1A]\'></div> <div class=\'flex flex-col\'> <span class=\'text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter\'>150+</span> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50\'>Empresas Atendidas</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'w-1/3 flex items-center\'> <div class=\'relative w-full aspect-[4/5] bg-[#14362D] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\'> <div class=\'absolute inset-0 opacity-20\' style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#D4AF37 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;\\\"></div> <div class=\'absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-end p-8 text-white\'> <div class=\'bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/10\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 block opacity-60\'>An\303\241lise de Fluxo</span> <div class=\'h-24 w-full flex items-end gap-1 mb-4\'> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#D4AF37] h-[40%] rounded-t-sm\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#D4AF37] h-[60%] rounded-t-sm\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#D4AF37] h-[55%] rounded-t-sm\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-white h-[90%] rounded-t-sm\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#D4AF37] h-[75%] rounded-t-sm\'></div> </div> <p class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Performance Mensal +22.4%</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'grid grid-cols-3 gap-8 pt-12 border-t border-[#14362D1A]\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-2\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37]\'>01. Consultoria</span> <h3 class=\'font-bold text-lg\'>Gest\303\243o de Fluxo</h3> <p class=\'text-xs opacity-60 leading-relaxed\'>Otimiza\303\247\303\243o de processos e controle rigoroso de tesouraria.</p> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-2\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37]\'>02. Planejamento</span> <h3 class=\'font-bold text-lg\'>Estrat\303\251gia Fiscal</h3> <p class=\'text-xs opacity-60 leading-relaxed\'>Redu\303\247\303\243o inteligente de custos e conformidade tribut\303\241ria.</p> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-2\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37]\'>03. Tecnologia</span> <h3 class=\'font-bold text-lg\'>Dashboard em Tempo Real</h3> <p class=\'text-xs opacity-60 leading-relaxed\'>Seus n\303\272meros acess\303\255veis de qualquer lugar, a qualquer hora.</p> </div> </div> </main> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (fl