 am now creating individual service cards, considering hover effects and visual appeal. I\'m prioritizing concise descriptions within each card for clarity.\n\n\n**Expanding Service Details**\n\nI am now focusing on refining the content within each service card. I\'ve added concise descriptions to each. Specifically, I\'m working on details for \"contas a pagar, receber, fluxo de caixa e concilia\303\247\303\243o banc\303\241ria,\" \"valuation,\" and \"reestrutura\303\247\303\243o\" to provide clarity to the user. I\'m prioritizing accuracy and brevity.\n\n\n"
