  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Project Implementation**\n\nOkay, I\'ve started breaking down the request. I\'m focusing on integrating GSAP ScrollTrigger and SplitText to create animated hero headlines and smooth scroll-based entries for page sections, matching the design. I\'m aiming for a seamless and responsive implementation.\n\n\n**Reviewing Code Implementation**\n\nI\'m now revisiting the codebase. I see that `gsap`, `ScrollTrigger`, and `SplitType` are in place. Both `Home.tsx` and `Consultoria.tsx` utilize `SplitType` for hero headlines and `ScrollTrigger` for section entries. The goal is to elevate the \"high-end\" feel, which is subjective. Now I\'ll focus on animation refinement, perhaps with more staggered effects and applying animations to additional elements. I will be reviewing and refactoring what is already in place.\n\n\n**Refining Animation Styles**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics. Looking at the existing animations in `Home.tsx` and `Consultoria.tsx`, I\'m pinpointing areas for refinement. I\'ve taken inspiration from the ERA Residence site, specifically its smooth, masked character reveals. I\'m aiming to transition the hero animations, especially, toward this luxurious feel, thinking about slow easing and, specifically, adding mask-like clipping effects. I\'m also planning to incorporate ScrollTrigger for section titles and refine the existing service card animations for a more polished presentation.\n\n\n**Enhancing Animation Refinement**\n\nNow I\'m focusing on the implementation details to refine animations. I\'m adding `ScrollTrigger` to section titles (\"Metodologia\", \"O Processo\"). I\'m planning to replace `back.out(1.7)` easing with `expo.out` or `power4.out` and extend the animation duration. I\'ll stagger words or lines instead of characters, or add subtle char effects. I\'m also going to incorporate masking effects, perhaps `clipPath` with `overflow:hidden`, or GSAP y+opacity with `expo.out`. My plan involves reading and updating the GSAP logic in both `Home.tsx` and `Consultoria.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 11
      nanos: 57821305
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
