  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Design Integration**\n\nI\'m currently focused on integrating the `lucide-react` library. The objective is to enhance the \"Solu\303\247\303\265es Corporativas\" section with minimalist icons that align seamlessly with the existing *Cormorant Garamond* and *Montserrat* typography. I am evaluating the best integration approach.\n\n\n**Evaluating Icon Selection**\n\nI\'ve examined the Home page structure and service cards, and the goal is to integrate minimalist icons from `lucide-react`. I identified the need for icons for BPO Financeiro, Valuation, Reestrutura\303\247\303\243o, and M&A services, noting suitable imports already in `Home.tsx`. I\'m leaning toward \'Briefcase\' or \'Calculator\' for BPO, \'Scale\' or \'Diamond\' for Valuation, and further exploration is needed for the remaining services.\n\n\n**Finalizing Icon Choices**\n\nI\'ve made my final icon selections: `Calculator` for BPO Financeiro, `Gem` for Valuation, `Activity` for Reestrutura\303\247\303\243o, and `Handshake` for M&A. I also reviewed the service card HTML to prepare for integration, and now I\'m ready to proceed with integrating these icons into their respective service cards.\n\n\n**Refining Integration Positioning**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating the icons into the service cards, specifically the placement. I\'ve decided on a top-right corner placement within a flex header, aligning them with the labels. I\'m aiming for a subtle visual enhancement to the service cards. I\'m exploring how to modify the `Home.tsx` structure to accommodate the icons within a flex header.\n\n\n"
