strutura\303\247\303\243o</h4>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-[#535458] leading-relaxed font-light tracking-wide\">\n              Planos de recupera\303\247\303\243o financeira e renegocia\303\247\303\243o de passivos. Trazemos f\303\264lego para empresas em momentos de transi\303\247\303\243o ou crise.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"service-card p-16 bg-[#FFFFFF] hover:bg-[#FDFCFB] transition-colors group\">\n            <span className=\"text-[#D8B36B] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-8 block\">/ M&A</span>\n            <h4 className=\"service-title text-2xl font-serif uppercase tracking-widest font-light mb-6 group-hover:text-[#D8B36B] transition-colors text-[#232A1B]\">M&A (Fus\303\265es)</h4>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-[#535458] leading-relaxed font-light tracking-wide\">\n              Assessoria ponta a ponta na compra e venda de empresas. Do mapeamento de mercado ao fechamento estrat\303\251gico da opera\303\247\303\243o.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>"
