  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Animation Goal**\n\nRight now, I\'m focusing on the core purpose: crafting a trust-building section, aiming for high reliability via statistics or success icons. The crucial element is a staggered animation reveal. I\'m visualizing how to make that reveal both eye-catching and effectively convey the data.\n\n\n**Refining the Concept**\n\nNow, I\'m integrating GSAP `ScrollTrigger` for a smooth reveal as users scroll. The target audience is service providers, so I\'m aiming for a friendly, premium tone with light mode and Favo brand colors. Content-wise, I\'ve narrowed down the stats to reflect peace of mind and growth: time saved, clarity, partner businesses, and a focus on humanized service. I\'m visualizing a clean horizontal grid layout to present these stats.\n\n\n**Implementing the Indicators**\n\nI\'ve decided to place the trust indicators either after the Hero section or the Pain Points section, to build trust early on. I\'m creating a new `TrustIndicators.tsx` component for cleaner code, and I\'ve started the GSAP animation using `ScrollTrigger` with a staggered reveal. The animations will use `y: 40`, `opacity: 0`, and `stagger: 0.15`. I\'m starting on the new component by importing the `Clock`, `Target`, `Users`, and `MessageCircle` icons. I\'m also planning to style the component with a top/bottom border, `#F7F6EE` background, and `#232A1B` text. Large numbers will be serif font, and small descriptions will be sans-serif.\n\n\n**Integrating the Animation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating the trust indicators. I\'ve realized I need to register `ScrollTrigger` in both the main component, `Home.tsx`, and the `TrustIndicators.tsx` component, though `useGSAP` in the child component should be fine since it\'s registered globally in `Home.tsx`, but to be safe, `gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger)` in `TrustIndicators.tsx` too. I\'ve decided to build the trust indicators as a separate component for better modularity, starting in `src/components/TrustIndicators.tsx`.\n\n\n**Refining the Stats**\n\nI\'ve just added two new stats: \"Jarg\303\265es Complexos\" (Zero) and \"Tranquilidade\" (24/7), focusing on clear communication and peace of mind. I\'m tweaking the GSAP animation to reflect these additions and ensure a balanced flow. I\'m exploring different easing options for a polished look and feel, so they flow naturally.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 17
      nanos: 87628855
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
