  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining the Pitch**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `/src/pages/Consultoria.tsx` page and how to improve its sales pitch. The aim is to create a compelling proposal that highlights the consulting services\' robust nature while maintaining simplicity. My goal is to clearly demonstrate how the consulting process can benefit users by providing straightforward strategies and fundamental knowledge to achieve tangible results.\n\n\n**Developing the Concept**\n\nI\'m now exploring gamification within the `/src/pages/Consultoria.tsx` section. The goal is to visually represent the time-saving benefits of my consulting services using elements already on the site. I am planning a highly interactive element to visually demonstrate how quickly finances can be organized using this simplified, high-value process.\n\n\n**Crafting the Methodology**\n\nI\'ve decided to build an interactive slider or timeline to showcase my methodology. Using GSAP ScrollTrigger, I\'ll pin the section and animate progress through the steps. The goal is a visual \"Path to Clarity\" with the user progressing to unlock simplicity. This will be the \"Sua Jornada em 3 Passos Simples\" section, a visual representation of the financial organization process.\n\n\n**Designing the Visual**\n\nI am now focusing on the interactive method component and revising the \"Consultoria\" section. My plan is to create an Interactive Method Component. I\'m aiming for a visual progress bar that provides a gamified feeling and clarifies the consulting steps. The aim is to represent the journey from \"Chaos\" to \"Clarity\" through interactive clicks. I am updating section copy for more impact.\n\n\n**Implementing the Design**\n\nI\'ve decided on an interactive step-by-step \"Acelerador de Resultados\" (Results Accelerator) section with four steps. As the user clicks each, a progress ring fills, adding gamification to the process. I\'m focusing on \"Desbloqueie seu Lucro\" (Unlock your Profit). This will visually demonstrate how a complicated task can be streamlined into a quick, five-minute approval. I\'m moving toward implementing this directly in a new `InteractiveJourney.tsx` component. The steps include a \"Raio-X (Onde estamos?)\" for mapping accounts, and defining personal and professional separation with a pro-labore component.\n\n\n**Finalizing the Steps**\n\nI\'m now implementing the four steps for the \"Acelerador de Resultados\" section, aiming for a gamified feel using circular progress indicators animated with GSAP. The section will guide users through automation, removing bureaucracy and ultimately leading to increased profit. I\'ve removed the overly corporate \"Fases do Projeto\" from `/src/pages/Consultoria.tsx` to streamline the user experience, integrating an interactive journey component instead.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 13
      nanos: 400729690
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
