    thinking: "**Defining the Scope**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the scope: Adding a \"Tangible Results\" section to the app is the main goal. It looks like `recharts` is the visualization library we\'ll use to present the impact of the app to the user, so this is where I\'ll begin.\n\n\n**Pinpointing Key Benefits**\n\nI\'m now identifying Favo\'s tangible financial benefits. I\'m thinking of a \"Tangible Results\" section for the financial management page. I\'ll need to illustrate reductions in time spent on bureaucracy and increased cash flow efficiency using `recharts`. I\'ll build a modular component, and place it in the *Gest\303\243o Financeira* page, as it strongly supports the recurring service value proposition. I will also check the dependencies to see if `recharts` is installed.\n\n\n**Implementing the Charts**\n\nI\'ve got the Recharts implementation plan mapped out now, including the install, component creation, and integration steps. I\'ll focus on crafting two concise charts side-by-side, one a bar chart showing time savings on bureaucracy and the other an area chart illustrating cash flow clarity. Minimalist design is the goal, stripping away extraneous visual elements to highlight the key data. The goal is to do this in the current execution phase.\n\n\n"
