  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Begin Visualizing a Journey**\n\nI\'m now focusing on visualizing a \"6-Week Journey\" for the \'Consultoria\' page. The plan involves detailing four key meetings within this framework and presenting them in a clear, engaging format. I\'m exploring different ways to represent the content so the four \"encontros\" are well understood.\n\n\n**Adding a Visual Timeline**\n\nI\'m now integrating a vertical timeline for the \"6-Week Journey\" to `Consultoria.tsx`. I\'ll build a dedicated `ConsultingTimeline.tsx` component to host this new visualization, as the prompt specifies a need for *addition* and *detail*. I\'m also addressing the 90-day support, aiming for an interactive, vertical timeline. The term \"premium\" in the support description will be removed to prevent any misuse.\n\n\n**Constructing the Timeline Component**\n\nI\'m currently developing the `ConsultingTimeline.tsx` component, focusing on a vertical timeline visualization. The content for each \"Encontro\" is detailed, including identification of bottlenecks, strategy mapping, application of tools, and review. I\'m incorporating scroll-triggered GSAP animations for interactive engagement, such as fade-ins and line drawings. Also, the 90-day support via WhatsApp is mentioned, with the word \"premium\" removed.\n\n\n**Refining the Text**\n\nI\'ve just edited `src/pages/Consultoria.tsx` to remove \"premium\" from the \"90 Dias de Suporte\" text, which is now \"Suporte durante 90 dias via WhatsApp para tirar d\303\272vidas e destravar processos.\" This addresses the earlier concern. Now, I will create `ConsultingTimeline.tsx` and integrate it into `Consultoria.tsx`, most likely replacing the `InteractiveJourney` component to maintain clarity in the presentation.\n\n\n**Implementing the Timeline**\n\nI am now replacing the `InteractiveJourney` with the new `ConsultingTimeline` component in `Consultoria.tsx`. I decided on a vertical timeline on the left side, which is cleaner and responsive. I\'m using GSAP ScrollTrigger to draw the line and reveal the content step-by-step. The line will have nodes for each of the four \"Encontros\" and the 90-day support via WhatsApp.\n\n\n**Detailing Timeline Content**\n\nI\'ve just added detailed descriptions for each \"Encontro\" to the timeline. Each step now features a title, subtitle (\"Semana X\" or \"P\303\263s-Consultoria\"), and a concise description of the meeting\'s focus. The final entry, representing 90-day support, is marked as `isFinal`. This is all to improve the usability and understanding of the timeline\'s contents.\n\n\n"
