ded to add it before the CTA on the Gest\303\243o Financeira page, considering the pricing information. I\'ve also refined the testimonial data, adding a `stars` field to each entry, which is more relevant to Gestao Financeira.\n\n\n**Refining the Presentation**\n\nI\'ve decided on the section title: \"O que dizem sobre a Favo\". The layout will be a masonry grid, and I\'ve set the CSS columns. I\'ll use `columns-1 md:columns-2 lg:columns-3 gap-6` to ensure it looks good on all screen sizes. I also have the data that I will use and plan to ensure the display is high quality.\n\n\n"
