  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Form Strategy**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the form strategy. My initial thinking revolved around a form for each product: Gest\303\243o Financeira/BPO, Consultoria, and possibly Diagn\303\263stico/Geral. I aim to create forms that do more than collect contact info; they\'ll serve as \"mini-assessments.\"\n\n\n**Refining Form Integration**\n\nNow I\'m diving into how to best integrate these forms. I\'m leaning toward a dedicated lead capture component, `LeadCaptureForm`, that adapts to each service. Considering a sleek design, in-page forms or drawer/modal displays seem ideal. Questions for BPO clients are taking shape, like monthly average revenue and current challenges.\n\n\n**Structuring Form Questions**\n\nI\'ve been working on structuring the form questions in more detail now. For BPO, I\'m thinking of questions around average monthly revenue and current financial pain points, such as late payments or lack of clarity. For Consultoria, questions will cover the primary objective, like organizational needs or pricing improvements. I\'m also including standard fields like name, email, WhatsApp, company name, and Instagram handle.\n\n\n**Outlining Component Implementation**\n\nI\'m now outlining a step-by-step implementation plan. I\'ll begin with the `LeadCaptureForm.tsx` component, parameterizing it by `serviceType`. Next I\'ll integrate the form into the service pages, starting with `GestaoFinanceira.tsx` and `Consultoria.tsx`. I will then create an `InstagramFeed.tsx` component with a grid layout. The plan is to include the feed on `Home.tsx` and potentially other pages, such as services pages, or possibly globally.\n\n\n**Implementing Global Content**\n\nI\'ve decided to add global content above the footer; it will be a separate component within `Layout.tsx`. Next on my mind is refining the `LeadCaptureForm.tsx`. I will leverage React state for a multi-step design, aiming for a powerful assessment feel. The first step will be contact information, followed by profiling (conditional on service) and finally a success message. I\'ll use standard Tailwind with Lucide icons for a sleek aesthetic, and a specific color theme. Furthermore, I have data points in mind for the BPO form, regarding monthly transactions and financial control methods.\n\n\n**Designing Instagram Feed**\n\nI\'m now focusing on designing the Instagram feed component, `InstagramFeed.tsx`. My goal is a grid of 4-5 square images with a hover state displaying a dark overlay and heart/comment icons. The plan is to link each image to `@favogestao`, using placeholder images from Unsplash that feature a business/finance aesthetic, such as images of spreadsheets, coffee, laptops, and aesthetic offices.\n\n\n**Implementing Image Feed**\n\nI\'ve gathered image URLs to populate the Instagram feed. I have placeholder links, and specific business and finance themed images for the component, for now, before I move to actual Instagram data. I\'m focusing on implementation details. I also plan on creating a `LeadCaptureForm` component, and integrating it into the service pages.\n\n\n\n**Integrating Global Content**\n\nI\'ve decided to integrate the Instagram feed globally. Instead of placing it at the bottom of `Home.tsx`, I\'ll add it to `Layout.tsx` directly above the footer. This ensures a consistent \"Acompanhe no Instagram\" presence across the entire site. I am now drafting the `LeadCaptureForm.tsx` component and the `InstagramFeed.tsx` components.\n\n\n**Defining Page Updates**\n\nI\'m now focused on modifying the `Layout.tsx`, `GestaoFinanceira.tsx`, and `Consultoria.tsx` files. I plan to use `default_api:create_file` for both `LeadCaptureForm.tsx` and `InstagramFeed.tsx` components. I\'m also refining the form fields and choices for the different services, listing common fields and service-specific questions. For BPO, I\'m defining questions about financial difficulties and monthly transaction volume, with response options. Likewise for Consultoria, I\'m drafting questions around objectives and financial control methods.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 49
      nanos: 833759522
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
