  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Revising Footer Structure**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the website footer. I\'ve noted the existing elements: quick links, contact info, and the logo. My goal now is to update the footer. I plan to add essential navigation links to pages like \"In\303\255cio\", \"Gest\303\243o Financeira\", and \"Consultoria\". Also, I must integrate social media icons in the footer.\n\n\n**Structuring Footer Components**\n\nI\'ve been working on restructuring the footer grid. I\'m now aiming for a 4-column layout: Brand, Quick Links, Our Solutions, and Contact. The Brand column will feature the logo, a brief description, and social media icons (Instagram, LinkedIn, WhatsApp, etc.). \"Quick Links\" will include navigation to essential pages, and \"Our Solutions\" will detail service offerings. I\'m implementing `lucide-react` for the social icons. I\'ve started writing the `Footer.tsx` file to reflect this new layout.\n\n\n**Refining Brand Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating the brand elements. I\'ve placed the logo and a concise mission statement within the first column. I am incorporating social media links for Instagram and LinkedIn, styled consistently with the brand. I\'ve also incorporated a small description of the brand, aimed at high growth strategies. I\'m focusing on ensuring these elements are visually cohesive within the layout.\n\n\n**Finalizing Social Links**\n\nI\'ve just finalized the social media links integration, adding LinkedIn and a WhatsApp link. I\'ve styled them to ensure visual consistency with the brand guidelines, and the links now open in new tabs. I\'m leveraging the `lucide-react` library for the icons, ensuring they align perfectly with the overall design. I\'m focusing on responsiveness, to ensure usability across all devices.\n\n\n**Adding Solution Links**\n\nI\'ve added the \"Solu\303\247\303\265es\" (Solutions) section to the footer. I\'ve included links to \"BPO Financeiro\" and \"Consultoria Estrat\303\251gica\", consistent with the site\'s structure. I\'ve styled them to ensure visual consistency and added subtle hover effects to improve user interaction. I\'ve paid special attention to accessibility and responsiveness.\n\n\n**Incorporating Contact Details**\n\nI\'m now integrating contact information. I\'ve added an email address and phone number with corresponding icons to the footer\'s contact section, using `Mail` and `Phone` from `lucide-react`. I\'ve styled them with hover effects and ensured they\'re visually consistent with the existing footer design. I\'ve also focused on clear presentation.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 23
      nanos: 333253934
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
