    thinking: "**Considering Icon Animation**\n\nI\'m currently focused on how to handle animations with individual icons. Right now, my thoughts center around importing these icons directly and then feeding them into an `animation` prop. I\'m exploring an example where I bring in folder, lock, and activity icons from \'react-useanimations\'.\n\n\n**Analyzing Icon Choices**\n\nOkay, I\'ve shifted focus to analyzing these `react-useanimations` icons. I\'m verifying the elegance of `explore`, `heart`, and `thumbUp` by checking their visual appearance and size. They\'re feather-icons animated, which is excellent! The outline style is a perfect match for `lucide-react`. I\'m also now testing `strokeColor` and `fillColor` to make sure they\'ll fit with the overall design. Then I need to add animations in \"FinancialBenefits.\"\n\n\n**Evaluating Icon Libraries**\n\nI\'ve been evaluating different icon libraries for my project. I\'m leaning toward using `react-useanimations` and have verified a few icons. I\'m now also considering `dotlottie-react` with LottieFiles\' public CDN, but the lack of an open API to search for specific assets is a roadblock. I\'m also exploring `Lordicon` via CDN as another alternative.\n\n\n"
