       <div className=\"w-full md:w-1/2 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n            <div className=\"security-item p-6 border border-[#472f5b]/10 bg-[#fffff0] hover:border-[#D8B36B]/50 transition-colors\">\n              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 mb-4 rounded-full bg-[#D8B36B]/10 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <FileText className=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#D8B36B]\" />\n              </div>\n              <h4 className=\"text-sm font-serif uppercase tracking-widest text-[#472f5b] mb-2\">Garantia Contratual</h4>\n              <p className=\"text-xs text-[#4e653d] font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                Nossa atua\303\247\303\243o \303\251 formalizada juridicamente com cl\303\241usulas estritas de confidencialidade (NDA), assegurando que seus dados nunca sejam expostos.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"security-item p-6 border border-[#472f5b]/10 bg-[#fffff0] hover:border-[#D8B36B]/50 transition-colors\">\n              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 mb-4 rounded-full bg-[#D8B36B]/10 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <Lock className=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#D8B36B]\" />\n              </div>\n              <h4 className=\"text-sm font-serif uppercase tracking-widest text-[#472f5b] mb-2\">Acesso Restrito</h4>\n              <p className=\"text-xs text-[#4e653d] font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                Adotamos pol\303\255ticas de acesso com permiss\303\265es controladas. Apenas analistas dedicados ao seu projeto ter\303\243o vis\303\243o \303\240s suas movimenta\303\247\303\265es.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"
