rail. I also implemented `isHoveringText` to stop animation on inputs.\n\n\n**Managing Hover States**\n\nMy focus has shifted to managing hover states within `BeeCursor.tsx`. I\'m implementing logic to track whether the mouse is over interactive elements like links, buttons, and those with a `role=\"button\"`. I\'m using `isHoveringInteractive`, and `isHoveringText` to update the visibility and behavior of the bee cursor and pollen animation. This includes ensuring the visual elements respond correctly to changes in mouse position.\n\n\n"
