  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Acceptance**\n\nOkay, so the user responded with a simple \"bora,\" indicating agreement with the recent proposal. That proposal was to implement the \"Expert\'s Letter\" section, featuring Andryelle\'s photo, to anchor the identity. It seems like we have a green light on that.\n\n\n**Crafting the Specialist Section**\n\nI\'m now diving into the \"Carta da Especialista\" component. I\'ve named it `FounderLetter.tsx` and am focusing on an elegant, asymmetrical, high-contrast visual style. The content will be a placeholder for Andryelle\'s photo, urging the user to replace it. The letter itself will be empathetic, focusing on her personal story and understanding the user\'s pain points. I\'m aiming for a magazine-editorial feel with a Serif font and a handwritten-style signature for her name. The layout will adapt to desktop and mobile displays.\n\n\n**Refining Visuals**\n\nI\'m now iterating on the visual design for the \"Carta da Especialista\" section. I\'ve decided to go with an ivory background and dark purple text for a classic letter feel, with gold accents. I\'m also finalizing the copywriting: the headline will be \"Por tr\303\241s dos n\303\272meros, existe o seu sonho,\" and the body copy will focus on the freedom Favo provides.\n\n\n**Positioning Section Component**\n\nI\'ve decided to integrate the `FounderLetter.tsx` component directly into `Home.tsx`, either before the \"TangibleResults\" or \"Testimonials\" section. I\'ll use the `lucide-react` library for a subtle quote icon, if needed.\n\n\\n\\n\n\nI\'m now drafting the component, and I\'ve decided to use a high-quality Unsplash image of a professional woman as a placeholder. I\'m focusing on making this image visually appealing so the client understands the vision clearly. The Unsplash image will be used to show the client\'s vision clearly.\n\n\n**Visualizing Presentation**\n\nI\'ve completed the basic structure of the FounderLetter component. I\'ve integrated a decorative frame and a placeholder image, pulled from Unsplash, into the design. The placeholder features a professional image, which will be styled with a subtle grayscale filter that removes on hover. The structure includes a floating badge, hinting at the component\'s interactive elements.\n\n\n**Developing Component Content**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the text content within the component. I\'ve integrated a \"Fundadora\" badge with Andryelle\'s name. I\'m focusing on a headline: \342\200\234Eu j\303\241 vi neg\303\263cios incr\303\255veis estagnarem n\303\243o por falta de clientes, mas por caos financeiro.\" I\'m then drafting the body copy to focus on how Favo was developed to overcome this problem.\n\n\n**Formulating Narrative**\n\nI\'m now crafting the letter\'s core message. I want to emphasize how small business owners seek freedom and impact, not weekend bookkeeping. I\'m focusing on the owner\'s loss of control and its impact on peace. My goal is for Favo to be the solution. I\'m shaping the narrative around regaining control. I\'m aiming to articulate that Favo provides the organization, clarity, and predictability needed to grow a business.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 24
      nanos: 606293897
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
