    wait_ms_before_async: 5000
    command_line: "cat << \'EOF\' > src/components/FounderLetter.tsx\nimport React from \'react\';\nimport { Quote } from \'lucide-react\';\n\nexport default function FounderLetter() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"py-24 bg-[#fffff0] relative overflow-hidden\">\n      {/* Subtle background element */}\n      <div className=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-[#472f5b]/5 skew-x-12 translate-x-1/2\"></div>\n      \n      <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10\">\n        <div className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-16 lg:gap-24\">\n          \n          {/* Image side */}\n          <div className=\"w-full md:w-1/2 relative\">\n            <div className=\"relative aspect-[4/5] max-w-md mx-auto md:ml-auto\">\n              {/* Decorative frame */}\n              <div className=\"absolute -inset-4 border border-[#866428]/30 translate-x-4 translate-y-4\"></div>\n              {/* Image Placeholder - A profissional de finan\303\247as */}\n              <img \n                src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800\" \n                alt=\"Andryelle - Especialista Financeira\" \n                className=\"w-full h-full object-cover filter grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700 relative z-10\"\n              />\n              {/* Floating badge */}\n              <div className=\"absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-[#472f5b] text-[#fffff0] p-6 shadow-xl z-20\">\n                <p className=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-light mb-1 text-[#D8B36B]\">Fundadora</p>\n                <p className=\"text-sm font-serif tracking-wide\">Andryelle</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Text side */}\n          <div className=\"w-full md:w-1/2\">\n            <Quote className=\"w-12 h-12 text-[#866428]/20 mb-8\" />\n            \n            <h2 className=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-light text-[#472f5b] mb-8 leading-tight\">\n              \"J\303\241 vi neg\303\263cios incr\303\255veis estagnarem n\303\243o por falta de clientes, mas por <span className=\"italic text-[#866428]\">caos financeiro.</span>\"\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div className=\"space-y-6 text-sm font-normal text-[#2a3a1e] leading-relaxed tracking-wide max-w-lg\">\n              <p>\n                A Favo n\303\243o nasceu para ser apenas uma terceiriza\303\247\303\243o de planilhas. Nasceu porque acredito que voc\303\252 abriu sua empresa para ter liberdade e impacto, n\303\243o para ser ref\303\251m de concilia\303\247\303\265es banc\303\241rias na sexta-feira \303\240 noite.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                Quando o dono do neg\303\263cio perde o controle dos n\303\272meros, ele perde a paz. Come\303\247a a misturar contas, precificar pelo \"feeling\" e trabalhar dobrado sem ver a cor do dinheiro no fim do m\303\252s.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                Nossa miss\303\243o na Favo \303\251 assumir os bastidores. N\303\263s organizamos a casa, trazemos clareza e previsibilidade, para que voc\303\252 possa voltar a focar naquilo que faz de melhor: <span className=\"font-medium text-[#472f5b]\">fazer sua empresa crescer.</span>\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div className=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[#472f5b]/10\">\n              <p className=\"text-2xl font-serif font-light italic text-[#472f5b]\">Andryelle</p>\n              <p className=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-light text-[#866428] mt-2\">CEO & Especialista Financeira</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\nEOF\n"
