  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Elevating Testimonials**\n\nI\'ve realized these are casual testimonials, not the premium \"Estudos de Caso\" we need. My focus is now on transforming them. I\'m considering how to elevate the language and presentation to reflect a top-tier BPO & Consultancy service.\n\n\n**Refining B2B Testimonials**\n\nI\'m aiming to keep the heart of the original testimonials while making them suitable for a B2B audience. My plan is to restructure the `testimonials` data to present real results. I\'m focusing on preserving the emotional aspect, using the data as the core, but adding professional context. The plan is to have a B2B professional feedback, with realistic context, and refined typography.\n\n\n**Balancing Testimonial Content**\n\nI\'m working to integrate both emotional and technical aspects within the testimonials. My current thinking is to blend personal client experiences with quantifiable business outcomes. The goal is to capture the human element, while keeping the data at the heart of each piece.\n\n\n**Analyzing Client Outcomes**\n\nI\'m now diving into specific client feedback. I\'m focusing on how the BPO services have directly impacted revenue, operational improvements, and strategic decision-making. I\'m looking at concrete data points, like financial clarity or investment strategies. My goal is to extract key results, framing each testimonial to demonstrate tangible value for potential B2B clients. I am also working on showcasing these new clients.\n\n\n"
