  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Problem**\n\nI\'ve got the core task in focus now. The user wants a GSAP-powered SVG animation that dynamically draws lines connecting financial pain points to Favo\'s solution points on scroll. It\'s a connection animation.\n\n\n**Refining the Visualization**\n\nI\'ve decided to explicitly draw branching paths from the main spine to each card for improved clarity. My initial SVG was just a single line, but I\'m now modifying it to include distinct horizontal branches. Using specific percentages of the SVG\'s height, the branches will originate from the main spine and connect to the respective cards. I\'m choosing to approach this by animating multiple paths instead of a complex timeline.\n\n\n**Implementing Branching Lines**\n\nI\'m now implementing horizontal branching lines directly within the component to guarantee clear connections. I\'ve added a `div` for each step, styled to appear as a growing horizontal line connecting from the center point to the respective card. This should offer a more visually distinct and satisfying user experience. I\'m modifying `OrganicJourney.tsx` to include these branching lines. The width of these lines will be animated with GSAP.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_851883"
      name: "edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Add branching lines to the GSAP animation that explicitly connect the center line to the cards\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"    // Animate glowing nodes on the path\\n    gsap.utils.toArray(\'.journey-dot-container\').forEach((dotContainer: any, i) => {\\n      const dot = dotContainer.querySelector(\'.journey-dot\');\\n      const ring = dotContainer.querySelector(\'.journey-ring\');\\n      const branch = dotContainer.parentElement.querySelector(\'.branch-line\');\\n\\n      const tl = gsap.timeline({\\n        scrollTrigger: {\\n          trigger: dotContainer,\\n          start: \\\"top 70%\\\",\\n          toggleActions: \\\"play none none reverse\\\"\\n        }\\n      });\\n\\n      // Dot appears\\n      tl.from(dot, { scale: 0, opacity: 0, duration: 0.5, ease: \\\"back.out(2)\\\" });\\n      \\n      // Branch grows to card\\n      if (branch) {\\n        tl.to(branch, { width: \'100%\', duration: 0.6, ease: \\\"power2.out\\\" }, \\\"-=0.2\\\");\\n      }\\n\\n      // Ring pulses\\n      tl.from(ring, { scale: 0, opacity: 0, duration: 0.4 }, \\\"-=0.4\\\");\\n    });\",\"TargetContent\":\"    // Animate glowing nodes on the path\\n    gsap.utils.toArray(\'.journey-dot\').forEach((dot: any) => {\\n      gsap.from(dot, {\\n        scale: 0,\\n        opacity: 0,\\n        duration: 0.8,\\n        ease: \\\"back.out(2)\\\",\\n        scrollTrigger: {\\n          trigger: dot,\\n          start: \\\"top 70%\\\",\\n          toggleActions: \\\"play none none reverse\\\"\\n        }\\n      });\\n    });\",\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/OrganicJourney.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Editing GSAP animations\",\"toolSummary\":\"Enhance GSAP animation\"}"
