  run_command {
    cwd: "."
    exit_code: 0
    blocking: true
    wait_ms_before_async: 5000
    combined_output {
      full: "<truncated 23 bytes>\nmb-6 uppercase tracking-widest text-[#472f5b]\">Medo dos N\303\272meros</h2>            <p className=\"text-sm text-[#2a3a1e] font-light leading-relaxed max-w-lg tracking-wide\">Planilhas complexas e termos dif\303\255ceis te assustam? Sem problemas. Traduzo seus resultados de forma simples, amig\303\241vel e did\303\241tica, para voc\303\252 ter seguran\303\247a em cada decis\303\243o.</p>          </div>        </div>      </section>      {/* About Andryelle Section */}      <section className=\"py-40 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto border-t border-[#472f5b]/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16 items-center\">        <FadeInUp className=\"flex-1\">          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\">            <span className=\"h-[1px] w-12 bg-[#D8B36B]\"></span>            <span className=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-light text-[#b2893d]\">Quem sou eu</span>          </div>          <h3 className=\"section-title text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-light tracking-widest uppercase mb-8\">            Andryelle<br/><span className=\"italic lowercase text-[#b2893d]\">Niederauer</span>          </h3>          <div className=\"space-y-6 text-[#2a3a1e] font-light text-sm tracking-wide leading-relaxed max-w-lg\">            <p>              Ol\303\241! Tudo bem? Sou a Andryelle Niederauer e trago uma bagagem s\303\263lida do mundo das finan\303\247as h\303\241 mais de 15 anos. Com forma\303\247\303\243o t\303\251cnica em administra\303\247\303\243o, experi\303\252ncia como gestora de projetos e atualmente graduanda em Gest\303\243o Financeira, sou apaixonada pelo mundo dos n\303\272meros.            </p>            <p>              Depois de uma jornada que inclui experi\303\252ncias em regime CLT e empreendedorismo em diferentes \303\241reas, decidi direcionar minha paix\303\243o e conhecimento para ajudar mulheres empreendedoras a crescerem seus neg\303\263cios de forma saud\303\241vel e sustent\303\241vel.            </p>            <p>              Acredito no poder das finan\303\247as bem geridas como pilar fundamental para o sucesso de qualquer empreendimento. Minha miss\303\243o \303\251 n\303\243o apenas oferecer servi\303\247os financeiros, mas tamb\303\251m fornecer orienta\303\247\303\243o e suporte personalizado para que cada mulher possa alcan\303\247ar seus objetivos empresariais com confian\303\247a e seguran\303\247a.            </p>          </div>        </FadeInUp>        <FadeInUp className=\"flex-1 w-full relative\" delay={0.2}>           <div className=\"aspect-[4/5] bg-[#FFFFFF] border border-[#472f5b]/10 p-4 shadow-xl relative z-10\">             <div className=\"w-full h-full bg-[#fffff0] flex items-center justify-center\">               <span className=\"font-serif italic text-3xl text-[#b2893d]\">A.N.</span>             </div>           </div>           <div className=\"absolute top-8 -right-8 w-full h-full border border-[#D8B36B] -z-10\"></div>        </FadeInUp>      </section>      {/* Trust Indicators Section */}      <FadeInUp>      <TrustIndicators />      </FadeInUp>      {/* Comparison Grid Section */}      <FadeInUp>      <OrganicJourney />      <BeforeAfterReveal />      <ComparisonGrid />      </FadeInUp>      {/* Services Section with ScrollTrigger */}      <section className=\"py-40 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto border-t border-[#472f5b]/10\">        <div className=\"mb-24 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-8\">          <div>            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\">              <span className=\"h-[1px] w-12 bg-[#D8B36B]\"></span>              <span className=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-light text-[#b2893d]\">Nossa Expertise</span>            </div>            <h3 className=\"section-title text-5xl md:text-7xl font-serif font-light tracking-widest uppercase\">Como Posso<br/><span className=\"italic lowercase text-[#b2893d]\">Ajudar</span></h3>          </div>          <p className=\"text-[#2a3a1e] font-light text-sm max-w-xs tracking-wide leading-relaxed\">            Solu\303\247\303\265es desenhadas para tirar o peso das suas costas e trazer organiza\303\247\303\243o real para o seu dia a dia.          </p>        </div>                <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-[#472f5b]/10 border border-[#472f5b]/10\">          <div className=\"service-card p-16 bg-[#FFFFFF] hover:bg-[#FDFCFB] transition-colors group relative\">            <div className=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">              <span className=\"text-[#b2893d] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block\">/ Terceiriza\303\247\303\243o</span>              <Calculator strokeWidth={1} className=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#b2893d] opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-500 ease-out\" />            </div>            <h4 className=\"service-title text-2xl font-serif uppercase tracking-widest font-light mb-6 group-hover:text-[#b2893d] transition-colors text-[#472f5b]\">BPO Financeiro</h4>            <p className=\"text-xs text-[#2a3a1e] leading-relaxed font-light tracking-wide\">              Delegue a rotina. Cuidamos do seu contas a pagar, receber, fluxo de caixa e concilia\303\247\303\243o banc\303\241ria, enquanto voc\303\252 foca no atendimento aos seus clientes.            </p>          </div>          <div className=\"service-card p-16 bg-[#FFFFFF] hover:bg-[#FDFCFB] transition-colors group relative\">            <div className=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">              <span className=\"text-[#b2893d] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block\">/ Planejamento</span>              <Map strokeWidth={1} className=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#b2893d] opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-500 ease-out\" />            </div>            <h4 className=\"service-title text-2xl font-serif uppercase tracking-widest font-light mb-6 group-hover:text-[#b2893d] transition-colors text-[#472f5b]\">Consultoria</h4>            <p className=\"text-xs text-[#2a3a1e] leading-relaxed font-light tracking-wide\">              M\303\243o na massa junto com voc\303\252. Estruturamos metas, planejamos o seu crescimento e organizamos suas finan\303\247as de forma simples e muito did\303\241tica.            </p>          </div>          <div className=\"service-card p-16 bg-[#FFFFFF] hover:bg-[#FDFCFB] transition-colors group relative\">            <div className=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">              <span className=\"text-[#b2893d] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block\">/ Clareza</span>              <PieChart strokeWidth={1} className=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#b2893d] opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-500 ease-out\" />            </div>            <h4 className=\"service-title text-2xl font-serif uppercase tracking-widest font-light mb-6 group-hover:text-[#b2893d] transition-colors text-[#472f5b]\">Diagn\303\263stico</h4>            <p className=\"text-xs text-[#2a3a1e] leading-relaxed font-light tracking-wide\">              N\303\243o sabe por onde come\303\247ar? Fazemos um raio-x completo do seu cen\303\241rio atual e entregamos um plano de a\303\247\303\243o claro, sem jarg\303\265es complicados.            </p>          </div>          <div className=\"service-card p-16 bg-[#FFFFFF] hover:bg-[#FDFCFB] transition-colors group relative\">            <div className=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">              <span className=\"text-[#b2893d] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block\">/ Crescimento</span>              <Lightbulb strokeWidth={1} className=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#b2893d] opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-500 ease-out\" />            </div>            <h4 className=\"service-title text-2xl font-serif uppercase tracking-widest font-light mb-6 group-hover:text-[#b2893d] transition-colors text-[#472f5b]\">Gest\303\243o Estrat\303\251gica</h4>            <p className=\"text-xs text-[#2a3a1e] leading-relaxed font-light tracking-wide\">              An\303\241lise dos seus resultados m\303\252s a m\303\252s. Mostramos onde est\303\243o os vazamentos de lucro e como melhorar seus pre\303\247os de forma amig\303\241vel e segura.            </p>          </div>        </div>      </section>      <FounderLetter />      {/* Interactive Calculator Section */}      <FadeInUp>        <WasteCalculator />      </FadeInUp>      {/* Testimonials / Social Proof Section */}      <FadeInUp>      <Testimonials />      </FadeInUp>    </div>  );}"
    }
    command_line: "cat src/pages/Home.tsx"
    proposed_command_line: "cat src/pages/Home.tsx"
    shell_name: "bash"
  }
}
