  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 1
    session_summary: "{\"step_index\":104,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T20:52:07Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":106,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T20:52:32Z\",\"content\":\"Uau, essa altera\303\247\303\243o elevou a sess\303\243o de Antes/Depois para outro patamar! \360\237\224\245\\n\\n**O que eu adicionei para criar a verdadeira imers\303\243o (fuga total do padr\303\243o \\\"IA\\\"):**\\n\\n1.  **Motion Design F\303\255sico e Fluido:** A barra n\303\243o \303\251 mais um \\\"input de HTML\\\" duro. Agora ela acompanha o mouse instantaneamente atrav\303\251s de uma \\\"f\303\255sica de mola\\\" (`useSpring`). O deslizar ficou viciante e liso. Al\303\251m disso, quando o site carrega, a barra faz uma anima\303\247\303\243o sozinha para a direita e esquerda, ensinando inconscientemente ao c\\n<truncated 796 bytes>\\n \\\"Conciliado: Todas as contas batem\\\".\\n4.  **Zoom Org\303\242nico (Scale):** Enquanto o cliente est\303\241 interagindo com a imagem, ela d\303\241 um micro-zoom lento de 5% para dentro, aumentando a imers\303\243o na cena.\\n\\nD\303\252 um refresh na p\303\241gina inicial e teste arrastar o mouse pela imagem (ou tocar no celular). Ficou extremamente interativo e prendendo a aten\303\247\303\243o! \\n\\nEssa era exatamente a conex\303\243o emocional que faltava. Quer que eu ajuste mais alguma anima\303\247\303\243o ou podemos descer para o Rodap\303\251/FAQ para fechar o funil da Home?\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T20:54:37Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nCrie um componente de anima\303\247\303\243o SVG interativa usando GSAP que conecte os \'pontos de dor\' (contas, caos) aos \'pontos de solu\303\247\303\243o\' (relat\303\263rios, paz) conforme o usu\303\241rio faz scroll, criando uma linha de conex\303\243o que se desenha organicamente na tela para evitar o efeito visual gen\303\251rico de IA.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-03T13:54:37-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.1-pro-preview\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-kcp5rp4aui3kwizmokeeav-323351888711.us-east1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-kcp5rp4aui3kwizmokeeav-323351888711.us-east1.run.app\\nUser Email: felipemassonp@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":94,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T20:54:37Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Defining the Visual Goal**\\n\\nI\'m now zeroing in on the visual aspect of the animation. The core idea is to smoothly connect \\\"pain points\\\" to \\\"solution points\\\" through an interactive SVG component controlled by scroll. The visual needs to clearly represent this transition as the user scrolls, maybe some sort of line animation?\\n\\n\\n\\n**Refining the Animation**\\n\\nI\'m now thinking about the specific animation style. I want an organic, hand-drawn look for the connecting line, moving away from anything that feels ge\\n<truncated 9236 bytes>\\nless math-intensive solution. I plan to use CSS `justify-content: space-between` to distribute the steps.\\n\\n\\n**Refining the Organic Curve**\\n\\nI\'m now implementing the organic curve as an SVG path. I\'ve opted for a sine wave-like path defined by a quadratic Bezier curve and subsequent smooth curves, which I\'m testing mentally. The goal is to perfectly center the curve in the layout and smoothly connect the journey stages, by drawing the path through the center (X=50), and letting it snake around the center.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":97,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T20:56:16Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":99,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T20:56:19Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":101,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T20:56:22Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":103,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T20:56:25Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":105,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T20:56:27Z\",\"content\":\"Acabei de implementar e subir um **Componente Org\303\242nico e Interativo** espetacular (\\\"A Jornada\\\") usando a biblioteca de anima\303\247\303\243o GSAP. \\n\\nPode recarregar o seu site na p\303\241gina inicial e rolar a p\303\241gina at\303\251 a se\303\247\303\243o *\\\"O Caminho\\\"*.\\n\\n**Como eu fugi do \\\"efeito de Intelig\303\252ncia Artificial\\\":**\\n1. **O Fio de Ouro (Scroll-Triggered SVG):** No centro da tela, h\303\241 uma linha que n\303\243o \303\251 reta e dura. Ela \303\251 um caminho sinuoso e org\303\242nico (curvas *bezier* super fluidas). Enquanto voc\303\252 rola a p\303\241gina para baixo, esse\\n<truncated 959 bytes>\\ns, o que tira a rigidez de blocos duros e d\303\241 um toque editorial refinado.\\n\\nEsse n\303\255vel de detalhe (ScrollTrigger interligando SVG com DOM) \303\251 o que diferencia os \\\"sites de template barato\\\" de sites de ag\303\252ncias premium que cobram 15 mil reais. A narrativa amarra a emo\303\247\303\243o perfeitamente!\\n\\nSe quiser, voc\303\252 j\303\241 pode testar o seu site rolando por esse bloco. Diga-me se era exatamente essa \\\"m\303\241gica conectiva\\\" que voc\303\252 tinha em mente, ou se quer que eu plugue agora os links de WhatsApp para fechar os contatos!\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":107,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-03T20:56:36Z\",\"content\":\"(O processo de build em background acabou de sinalizar verde! O componente `OrganicJourney` que comentei acima subiu com perfei\303\247\303\243o).\\n\\nO que voc\303\252 achou dessa linha temporal sendo constru\303\255da com o seu scroll? Tem mais alguma obje\303\247\303\243o pesada do seu cliente ideal que gostaria de colocar nesse \\\"fio de ouro\\\" de dores e solu\303\247\303\265es, ou j\303\241 quer que eu comece a fechar as frentes finais de links de contato?\"}\n{\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:02:14Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nImplemente a anima\303\247\303\243o de conex\303\243o SVG usando GSAP que conecta os pontos de dor financeiros aos pontos de solu\303\247\303\243o da Favo conforme o usu\303\241rio rola a p\303\241gina, criando linhas que se desenham organicamente.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-03T17:02:14-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.1-pro-preview\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-kcp5rp4aui3kwizmokeeav-323351888711.us-east1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-kcp5rp4aui3kwizmokeeav-323351888711.us-east1.run.app\\nUser Email: felipemassonp@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":87,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:02:14Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Animation Goal**\\n\\nI\'ve just implemented the basics of the SVG connection animation. My primary focus now is ensuring a smooth, organic drawing effect using GSAP, mapping pain points to solutions as the user scrolls. I\'m aiming for a visually compelling and intuitive representation of Favo\'s value proposition.\\n\\n\\n**Revisiting Implementation Strategy**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into the implementation details, puzzled as the prompt feels redundant. I\'ve re-examined the `OrganicJourney` component, confirm\\n<truncated 1265 bytes>\\no \\\"A Jornada\\\").\\nI will offer to tweak it if they want a different visual style (e.g.,\\n\\n\\n**Enhancing Line Organicism**\\n\\nI\'m now refining the SVG animation. I\'ll focus on making the lines more organic and explicit, potentially adding branching paths with GSAP\'s timeline or `stagger` for a more visually impactful connection. I\'ll update `OrganicJourney.tsx` to use a more complex SVG with explicit branches, clearly demonstrating the connection. I\'ll test it out and ensure I\'ve addressed the prompt\'s intent.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/app/applet/src/components/OrganicJourney.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":89,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:02:33Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"ls -la src/components\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\".\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"500\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":91,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:02:36Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"acf11a8b-c302-4116-bccc-16f5174cb85b/task-90\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":94,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:02:39Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"cat src/components/OrganicJourney.tsx\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\".\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"500\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":96,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:02:44Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"acf11a8b-c302-4116-bccc-16f5174cb85b/task-95\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":99,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:02:46Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Problem**\\n\\nI\'ve got the core task in focus now. The user wants a GSAP-powered SVG animation that dynamically draws lines connecting financial pain points to Favo\'s solution points on scroll. It\'s a connection animation.\\n\\n\\n**Refining the Visualization**\\n\\nI\'ve decided to explicitly draw branching paths from the main spine to each card for improved clarity. My initial SVG was just a single line, but I\'m now modifying it to include distinct horizontal branches. Using specific percentages of the \\n<truncated 158 bytes>\\nnstead of a complex timeline.\\n\\n\\n**Implementing Branching Lines**\\n\\nI\'m now implementing horizontal branching lines directly within the component to guarantee clear connections. I\'ve added a `div` for each step, styled to appear as a growing horizontal line connecting from the center point to the respective card. This should offer a more visually distinct and satisfying user experience. I\'m modifying `OrganicJourney.tsx` to include these branching lines. The width of these lines will be animated with GSAP.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"args\":{\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add branching lines to the GSAP animation that explicitly connect the center line to the cards\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"    // Animate glowing nodes on the path\\\\n    gsap.utils.toArray(\'.journey-dot-container\').forEach((dotContainer: any, i) => {\\\\n      const dot = dotContainer.querySelector(\'.journey-dot\');\\\\n      const ring = dotContainer.querySelector(\'.journey-ring\');\\\\\\n<truncated 658 bytes>\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"    // Animate glowing nodes on the path\\\\n    gsap.utils.toArray(\'.journey-dot\').forEach((dot: any) => {\\\\n      gsap.from(dot, {\\\\n        scale: 0,\\\\n        opacity: 0,\\\\n        duration: 0.8,\\\\n        ease: \\\\\\\"back.out(2)\\\\\\\",\\\\n        scrollTrigger: {\\\\n   \\n<truncated 136 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/OrganicJourney.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Editing GSAP animations\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Enhance GSAP animation\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":101,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:03:01Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"args\":{\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update HTML to support branch lines and dot containers\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"                    {/* Branching Line connecting Dot to Card */}\\\\n                    <div className={`branch-line absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[2px] z-0 ${isPain ? \'bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-[#472f5b]/20\' : \'bg-[#D8B36B]\'}`} \\\\n        \\n<truncated 1118 bytes>\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"                    {/* Connecting Dot (Mobile positioned left/right, Desktop centered) */}\\\\n                    <div className={`absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center ${isLeft ? \'-right-5 md:-right-16 md:translate-x\\n<truncated 506 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/OrganicJourney.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating HTML structure\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add branching lines\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":103,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:03:11Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"npm run build\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\".\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":105,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:03:25Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"acf11a8b-c302-4116-bccc-16f5174cb85b/task-104\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":108,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T00:03:28Z\",\"content\":\"O componente de conex\303\243o org\303\242nica usando GSAP que voc\303\252 descreveu \303\251 exatamente a se\303\247\303\243o **\\\"A Jornada\\\" (OrganicJourney)** que eu implementei no site agora h\303\241 pouco! \\n\\nEla est\303\241 posicionada logo acima da \303\241rea do *Antes/Depois* que mexemos na \303\272ltima rodada. \\n\\nMas aproveitando a sua mensagem, eu acabei de subir uma **nova atualiza\303\247\303\243o nessa se\303\247\303\243o para deixar a conex\303\243o ainda mais f\303\255sica e tang\303\255vel**:\\n1. O \\\"fio de ouro\\\" central continua descendo em tempo real enquanto o usu\303\241rio rola a p\303\241gina, mas ag\\n<truncated 302 bytes>\\na verdadeira \\\"\303\241rvore neural\\\" de conex\303\265es entre as Dores (\\\"Caos Di\303\241rio\\\", \\\"Sobrecarga\\\") e a Solu\303\247\303\243o (\\\"Paz e Lucratividade\\\"), fugindo completamente de layouts quadrados e engessados.\\n\\nD\303\252 uma rolada na p\303\241gina (no bloco *\\\"Como conectamos o seu caos \303\240 nossa clareza\\\"*) para ver as linhas puxando do centro direto para os textos!\\n\\nSe quiser, j\303\241 podemos partir para plugar os **links do seu WhatsApp** nos bot\303\265es, ou revisar a **se\303\247\303\243o de D\303\272vidas Frequentes (FAQ)** no final da p\303\241gina. Qual o pr\303\263ximo alvo?\",\"thinking\":\"**Confirming Design Alignment**\\n\\nI\'m pleased to report that the \\\"A Jornada\\\" section, also known as \\\"OrganicJourney\\\", is exactly as requested. It now dynamically connects pain points to solution points as the user scrolls. My design successfully addresses their specifications.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:19:04Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nAdicione efeitos de \'ScrollTrigger\' com GSAP para fazer os elementos de texto e se\303\247\303\265es da p\303\241gina surgirem com um leve efeito de fade-in e paralaxe, aumentando a sensa\303\247\303\243o de premium e fluidez no site.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-03T18:19:04-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.1-pro-preview\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-kcp5rp4aui3kwizmokeeav-323351888711.us-east1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-kcp5rp4aui3kwizmokeeav-323351888711.us-east1.run.app\\nUser Email: felipemassonp@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":109,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:19:04Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":111,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:19:09Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Considering Animation Alternatives**\\n\\nI\'m exploring options for the `FadeInUp` component. I\'m leaning toward integrating GSAP\'s `ScrollTrigger` for a richer, more versatile scroll experience. It offers parallax functionality, which aligns well with the design goals. I\'m also considering a bespoke solution, to create a new component.\\n\\n\\n\"}\n{\"step_index\":114,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:19:13Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Implementing ScrollTrigger Effects**\\n\\nI\'m now implementing the ScrollTrigger effects requested, focusing on GSAP\'s use for fade-in and parallax animations of text elements and page sections. This adjustment aims to meet the precise requirements.\\n\\n\\n\"}\n{\"step_index\":116,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:19:17Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Potential Revisions**\\n\\nI\'m currently evaluating options for optimization. Refactoring `FadeInUp` with GSAP promises broad application, but I\'m also considering a new `GsapReveal` component for text with parallax. Alternatively, I\'m thinking of altering the `Fade` component itself for a more focused improvement.\\n\\n\\n\"}\n{\"step_index\":118,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:19:22Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Considering Component Implementation**\\n\\nI\'m thinking about implementing a new component called `GsapReveal` to replace `FadeInUp` and introduce a parallax effect using GSAP. I\'m a bit concerned about replacing all instances of `FadeInUp` since it\'s used in both `GestaoFinanceira.tsx` and `Consultoria.tsx`.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Implementation Strategy**\\n\\nI\'ve realized I can modify `FadeInUp.tsx` directly to incorporate GSAP\'s `ScrollTrigger`, which feels like the cleanest approach. I\'m thinking of adding a `parallax` prop to control the effect. Updating `FadeInUp` makes sense since it can upgrade animations throughout the site. The current implementation uses motion, I will need to replace this with the GSAP animations, including `ScrollTrigger`.\\n\\n\\n\"}\n{\"step_index\":120,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:19:36Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":122,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:19:50Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":124,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:19:53Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":126,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:20:05Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":128,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:20:20Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":131,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:20:23Z\",\"content\":\"Acabei de realizar um **upgrade global no motor de anima\303\247\303\265es** do site. Substitu\303\255 a biblioteca antiga por um n\303\272cleo robusto rodando puramente via **GSAP ScrollTrigger**.\\n\\nO que isso significa na pr\303\241tica:\\n\\n1. **Fade-In Up Org\303\242nico:** Todos os elementos de texto e imagens do site (nas p\303\241ginas Home, Consultoria e Gest\303\243o) agora surgem \\\"debaixo para cima\\\" conforme voc\303\252 rola a p\303\241gina, de uma maneira muito mais org\303\242nica e luxuosa. A curva de velocidade foi ajustada para um *Power3.out* (arranca r\303\241pido \\n<truncated 559 bytes>\\n agora tem um efeito secund\303\241rio. Al\303\251m do parallax, o simples fato de pousar o mouse sobre ela dispara um zoom inercial lento, conectando o visual f\303\255sico ao movimento digital.\\n\\nPode rolar a p\303\241gina da Home do topo ao fim. Perceba como agora ela n\303\243o parece mais um \\\"pdf plano\\\", e sim algo com textura, peso e gravidade, gra\303\247as \303\240 interliga\303\247\303\243o do GSAP.\\n\\nO visual atingiu o estado da arte. Qual ser\303\241 nossa pr\303\263xima jogada? Links de WhatsApp, refinamentos nas outras p\303\241ginas (Consultoria/Gest\303\243o) ou rodap\303\251?\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":113,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-29T13:25:01Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nAdicione efeitos de \'hover\' magn\303\251ticos e micro-anima\303\247\303\265es aos bot\303\265es de chamada para a\303\247\303\243o (CTA) utilizando GSAP para aumentar a percep\303\247\303\243o de interatividade e modernidade.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-29T06:25:01-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-kcp5rp4aui3kwizmokeeav-323351888711.us-east1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-kcp5rp4aui3kwizmokeeav-323351888711.us-east1.run.app\\nUser Email: felipemassonp@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":114,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-29T13:25:01Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/app/applet/src/components/MagneticButton.tsx\\\"\"}}]}"
