  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Testimonials\' Location**\n\nI\'ve got `gsap` installed, which seems promising, especially with `Draggable` ready to go. Now, I\'m trying to decide if I need to adjust the current `Testimonials.tsx` file, or start fresh and replace/enhance it. I\'m aiming for something really stunning and fluid.\n\n\n**Designing Draggable Testimonials**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the architecture of the draggable testimonial carousel. I\'m leaning toward either updating `Testimonials.tsx` directly or creating a new component, `DraggableTestimonialsCarousel.tsx`. The goal is a fluid experience, perfectly integrating the existing brand. I\'m focusing on GSAP Draggable, horizontal tracks, inertia, visual indicators (drag hint cursor, pagination, arrows) and premium brand editorial design using the provided color palette. My next step is writing the polished component.\n\n\n**Verifying Draggable Implementation**\n\nI\'ve confirmed `Draggable` is accessible within the GSAP bundle, eliminating a potential hurdle. Now I need to review the code. It seems like a lot of the implementation details are already there, and I don\'t see any obvious errors. I\'m keen to move forward, and I\'ll explore more of the `Testimonials.tsx` file.\n\n\n**Analyzing Testimonials\' Data**\n\nI\'m now diving into the testimonial data itself, to understand its structure. I need to make sure the data is readily available and correctly formatted for dynamic display. I\'m thinking I\'ll need to extract individual pieces like author, role, company, testimonial text, highlight, and stars. I\'ll need to figure out how to arrange and style them for optimal visual presentation within the draggable carousel.\n\n\n**Implementing Carousel Control**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing the carousel controls (previous and next buttons) alongside index updates and GSAP transitions. I\'m leveraging `gsap.to` for the animation. I have calculated the card widths, set the target X positions for smooth transitions, and considered edge cases. I\'ve also added resize listeners to update bounds.\n\n\n**Refining UI Component Controls**\n\nI\'m now integrating the UI component controls, specifically the previous and next buttons. I\'m focusing on the visual feedback \342\200\223 color changes on hover and when disabled \342\200\223 matching the design provided. I\'ve also added the drag-to-explore indicator. I\'m making sure these interactions work flawlessly.\n\n\n\n**Finalizing Card Design**\n\nI\'ve just built out the testimonial card design with all provided fields: highlight, quote, text, author, role, and stars. I\'m focusing on the responsive layout, paying close attention to the visual hierarchy, including transitions and hover states. I\'m also implementing the highlight badge and the quote icon.\n\n\n**Refining Card Components**\n\nI\'m now putting the finishing touches on the testimonial card components. I\'m focusing on the responsive design, making sure that it looks great on all screen sizes. I\'m also fine-tuning the visual hierarchy, including the highlight, quote icon, text and author data, transitions, and hover states. I\'m making it fit well in the design that I\'ve been given.\n\n\n**Integrating Pagination Design**\n\nI\'ve just added the pagination dots, dynamically generating them based on the number of testimonials. Each dot updates with the active state, linked to the carousel\'s index. I\'ve also incorporated the \"show pricing\" element, and its styling, within the component, ensuring it displays correctly under the carousel. I\'ve finished implementing accessibility improvements, too.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_341995"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import { useRef, useState } from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport gsap from \\\"gsap\\\";\\nimport { Draggable } from \\\"gsap/Draggable\\\";\\nimport { ScrollTrigger } from \\\"gsap/ScrollTrigger\\\";\\nimport { useGSAP } from \\\"@gsap/react\\\";\\nimport { Star, Quote, TrendingUp, ChevronLeft, ChevronRight, Hand } from \\\"lucide-react\\\";\\n\\ngsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger, Draggable);\\n\\nconst testimonials = [\\n  {\\n    author: \\\"Juliana Librelon\\\",\\n    role: \\\"Propriet\303\241ria\\\",\\n    company: \\\"Cl\303\255nica de Est\303\251tica\\\",\\n    text: \\\"Andry, eu quero te abra\303\247ar! Eu n\303\243o t\303\264 acreditando que t\303\264 tirando essas f\303\251rias. J\303\241 t\303\264 at\303\251 programando a pr\303\263xima com as crian\303\247as. A tranquilidade de saber que o neg\303\263cio roda financeiramente sem mim n\303\243o tem pre\303\247o.\\\",\\n    highlight: \\\"Ganhou tempo e liberdade\\\",\\n    stars: 5\\n  },\\n  {\\n    author: \\\"Brunella Freitas\\\",\\n    role: \\\"CEO\\\",\\n    company: \\\"Ag\303\252ncia de Marketing\\\",\\n    text: \\\"A Andry \303\251 muito mais do que uma terceirizada. Cada solu\303\247\303\243o reflete o cuidado que ela dedica. Ela n\303\243o apenas entende nossas necessidades, mas nos ajuda a superar desafios de caixa. Pessoa de extrema confian\303\247a e compet\303\252ncia!\\\",\\n    highlight: \\\"Previsibilidade de Caixa\\\",\\n    stars: 5\\n  },\\n  {\\n    author: \\\"Graziele Cardoso\\\",\\n    role: \\\"S\303\263cia-Fundadora\\\",\\n    company: \\\"Escrit\303\263rio de Advocacia\\\",\\n    text: \\\"Eu s\303\263 sei as respostas exatas de quanto o escrit\303\263rio fatura e lucra porque tenho a melhor equipe cuidando disso para mim. Misturar conta de casa com a do escrit\303\263rio \303\251 coisa do passado.\\\",\\n    highlight: \\\"Controle e Clareza (PF/PJ)\\\",\\n    stars: 5\\n  },\\n  {\\n    author: \\\"Luiza Martini\\\",\\n    role: \\\"Diretora Criativa\\\",\\n    company: \\\"Est\303\272dio de Design\\\",\\n    text: \\\"Muito obrigada Andry, t\303\264 muito feliz que tu t\303\241 aqui com a gente. Ter previsibilidade pra saber quando podemos contratar e investir em equipamentos novos mudou completamente a nossa opera\303\247\303\243o.\\\",\\n    highlight: \\\"Crescimento Estruturado\\\",\\n    stars: 5\\n  },\\n  {\\n    author: \\\"B. Dias\\\",\\n    role: \\\"Fundadora\\\",\\n    company: \\\"E-commerce\\\",\\n    text: \\\"O suporte de voc\303\252s tem sido fundamental, voc\303\252s n\303\243o fazem ideia! O BPO tirou um peso enorme das minhas costas. Chega de pagar juros por esquecer vencimentos no meio da loucura das vendas.\\\",\\n    highlight: \\\"Zero Atrasos e Multas\\\",\\n    stars: 5\\n  },\\n  {\\n    author: \\\"Gabriel Soares\\\",\\n    role: \\\"Fundador\\\",\\n    company: \\\"Startup de Tecnologia\\\",\\n    text: \\\"Acho o m\303\241ximo que a Favo consegue nos dar essa visibilidade real dos n\303\272meros. N\303\243o sei o que seria da sa\303\272de financeira dessa empresa sem voc\303\252s. Obrigado por olharem estrategicamente pro nosso todo.\\\",\\n    highlight: \\\"Vis\303\243o Estrat\303\251gica\\\",\\n    stars: 5\\n  }\\n];\\n\\nexport default function Testimonials({ showPricing = false }: { showPricing?: boolean }) {\\n  const containerRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\\n  const trackRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\\n  const wrapperRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\\n  const draggableRef = useRef<any[]>([]);\\n  const [activeIndex, setActiveIndex] = useState(0);\\n\\n  useGSAP(() => {\\n    const track = trackRef.current;\\n    const wrapper = wrapperRef.current;\\n    if (!track || !wrapper) return;\\n\\n    const updateBounds = () => {\\n      const trackWidth = track.scrollWidth;\\n      const wrapperWidth = wrapper.clientWidth;\\n      const maxX = wrapperWidth - trackWidth;\\n\\n      if (draggableRef.current[0]) {\\n        draggableRef.current[0].kill();\\n      }\\n\\n      draggableRef.current = Draggable.create(track, {\\n        type: \\\"x\\\",\\n        bounds: { minX: maxX < 0 ? maxX : 0, maxX: 0 },\\n        inertia: true,\\n        edgeResistance: 0.65,\\n        dragResistance: 0.1,\\n        onDrag: function() {\\n          const progress = Math.abs(this.x) / Math.abs(maxX || 1);\\n          const index = Math.round(progress * (testimonials.length - 1));\\n          setActiveIndex(Math.max(0, Math.min(testimonials.length - 1, index)));\\n        },\\n        onThrowUpdate: function() {\\n          const progress = Math.abs(this.x) / Math.abs(maxX || 1);\\n          const index = Math.round(progress * (testimonials.length - 1));\\n          setActiveIndex(Math.max(0, Math.min(testimonials.length - 1, index)));\\n        }\\n      });\\n    };\\n\\n    updateBounds();\\n    window.addEventListener(\\\"resize\\\", updateBounds);\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      window.removeEventListener(\\\"resize\\\", updateBounds);\\n      if (draggableRef.current[0]) {\\n        draggableRef.current[0].kill();\\n      }\\n    };\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const handlePrev = () => {\\n    const track = trackRef.current;\\n    const wrapper = wrapperRef.current;\\n    if (!track || !wrapper) return;\\n    const newIndex = Math.max(0, activeIndex - 1);\\n    setActiveIndex(newIndex);\\n    const cardWidth = track.children[0] ? (track.children[0] as HTMLElement).offsetWidth + 32 : 400;\\n    const targetX = Math.min(0, -newIndex * cardWidth);\\n    gsap.to(track, { x: targetX, duration: 0.8, ease: \\\"power3.out\\\" });\\n    if (draggableRef.current[0]) {\\n      draggableRef.current[0].update();\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleNext = () => {\\n    const track = trackRef.current;\\n    const wrapper = wrapperRef.current;\\n    if (!track || !wrapper) return;\\n    const newIndex = Math.min(testimonials.length - 1, activeIndex + 1);\\n    setActiveIndex(newIndex);\\n    const cardWidth = track.children[0] ? (track.children[0] as HTMLElement).offsetWidth + 32 : 400;\\n    const trackWidth = track.scrollWidth;\\n    const wrapperWidth = wrapper.clientWidth;\\n    const maxX = wrapperWidth - trackWidth;\\n    const targetX = Math.max(maxX, -newIndex * cardWidth);\\n    gsap.to(track, { x: targetX, duration: 0.8, ease: \\\"power3.out\\\" });\\n    if (draggableRef.current[0]) {\\n      draggableRef.current[0].update();\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section ref={containerRef} className=\\\"py-32 border-t border-[#472f5b]/10 overflow-hidden bg-[#fffff0]\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-16 gap-8\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[#866428] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-6 block font-medium\\\">Casos Reais</span>\\n            <h2 className=\\\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-light tracking-wide text-[#472f5b]\\\">\\n              Empres\303\241rios que voltaram a <br/><span className=\\\"italic text-[#866428]\\\">dormir tranquilos.</span>\\n            </h2>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#472f5b]/60\\\">\\n              <Hand className=\\\"w-4 h-4 animate-pulse text-[#866428]\\\" />\\n              <span>Arraste para explorar</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n              <button \\n                onClick={handlePrev}\\n                aria-label=\\\"Depoimento anterior\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-[#472f5b]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[#472f5b] hover:bg-[#472f5b] hover:text-[#fffff0] hover:border-[#472f5b] transition-all duration-300 disabled:opacity-30\\\"\\n                disabled={activeIndex === 0}\\n              >\\n                <ChevronLeft className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n              <button \\n                onClick={handleNext}\\n                aria-label=\\\"Pr\303\263ximo depoimento\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-[#472f5b]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[#472f5b] hover:bg-[#472f5b] hover:text-[#fffff0] hover:border-[#472f5b] transition-all duration-300 disabled:opacity-30\\\"\\n                disabled={activeIndex === testimonials.length - 1}\\n              >\\n                <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Draggable Carousel Track Container */}\\n        <div ref={wrapperRef} className=\\\"overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing pb-8 -mx-6 px-6\\\">\\n          <div ref={trackRef} className=\\\"flex gap-8 select-none touch-pan-y\\\">\\n            {testimonials.map((item, idx) => (\\n              <div \\n                key={idx} \\n                className={`testimonial-card shrink-0 w-[360px] md:w-[420px] bg-[#FFFFFF] border p-10 shadow-[0_10px_30px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] relative group transition-all duration-500 ${activeIndex === idx ? \'border-[#866428] shadow-xl scale-[1.02]\' : \'border-[#472f5b]/10 hover:border-[#866428]/40\'}`}\\n              >\\n                {/* Highlight Badge */}\\n                <div className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#866428]/10 text-[#866428] px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-8\\\">\\n                  <TrendingUp className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold\\\">{item.highlight}</span>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <Quote className=\\\"w-10 h-10 text-[#866428]/20 absolute top-10 right-10\\\" />\\n\\n                <p className=\\\"text-sm md:text-base text-[#2a3a1e] font-light leading-[1.8] tracking-wide mb-10 min-h-[120px]\\\">\\n                  \\\"{item.text}\\\"\\n                </p>\\n                \\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 pt-6 border-t border-[#472f5b]/10\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-base font-serif text-[#472f5b]\\\">{item.author}</span>\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex gap-1 shrink-0\\\">\\n                      {[...Array(item.stars)].map((_, i) => (\\n                        <Star key={i} className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#D8B36B] fill-[#D8B36B]\\\" />\\n                      ))}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#866428] font-medium\\\">{item.role}</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs font-light text-[#2a3a1e]/80\\\">{item.company}</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Progress Pagination Bar */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\\\">\\n          {testimonials.map((_, idx) => (\\n            <button\\n              key={idx}\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                setActiveIndex(idx);\\n                const track = trackRef.current;\\n                const wrapper = wrapperRef.current;\\n                if (!track || !wrapper) return;\\n                const cardWidth = track.children[0] ? (track.children[0] as HTMLElement).offsetWidth + 32 : 400;\\n                const trackWidth = track.scrollWidth;\\n                const wrapperWidth = wrapper.clientWidth;\\n                const maxX = wrapperWidth - trackWidth;\\n                const targetX = Math.max(maxX, Math.min(0, -idx * cardWidth));\\n                gsap.to(track, { x: targetX, duration: 0.8, ease: \\\"power3.out\\\" });\\n                if (draggableRef.current[0]) {\\n                  draggableRef.current[0].update();\\n                }\\n              }}\\n              className={`h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-500 ${activeIndex === idx ? \'w-12 bg-[#866428]\' : \'w-3 bg-[#472f5b]/20 hover:bg-[#472f5b]/40\'}`}\\n              aria-label={`Ir para depoimento ${idx + 1}`}\\n            />\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {showPricing && (\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-20 flex justify-center\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"inline-block bg-[#866428] text-[#fffff0] px-10 py-5 shadow-xl\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-sm tracking-widest uppercase font-light\\\">\\n                Planos a partir de <strong className=\\\"font-semibold\\\">R$ 990,00</strong> / m\303\252s\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Testimonials.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Draggable Testimonials carousel component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Testimonials component\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
